The '''Carrion Spike''' was a location on the [[Carrion Plateau]] on the [[planet]] [[Eriadu]]. It was owned by the [[Tarkin family]]. It sat atop a hill and was made out of [[Color|black]] volcanic glass.<ref name="Tarkin" />

